    {
      "file": "backend/internal/pkg/timezone/timezone.go",
      "why": "Windows-only necessity. The timezone package calls time.LoadLocation at startup with the default Asia/Shanghai and upstream ships no tzdata; Windows has no system zoneinfo, so startup aborted and no business routes were registered (UI loaded, every API 404). A blank import of time/tzdata embeds the IANA database (+415744 bytes measured). Still absent upstream as of 0.2.16, so this patch is still required.",
